OL,3,GNEWSAPensions make up 86% of welfare
OL,4,Aspending
OL,5,
OL,6,FStates pensions accounted for 86% of
OL,7,Fbenefit expenditure from Guernsey's
OL,8,Fsocial security scheme last year.
OL,10,FThe spending breakdown for the Guernsey
OL,11,FInsurance Fund in 2025 was revealed in
OL,12,Fan Environment & Social Security (ESS)
OL,13,Fscrutiny meeting.
OL,15,FThe meeting covered a range of topics
OL,16,Fincluding income support and youth
OL,17,Femployment and also showed 30% of those
OL,18,Fon income support were pensioners.
OL,23,APub: 08-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
